+#   modules.txt: lines "mK|<file>|<base>|<arguments>||<per part>" (gen_two.sh). Output: C for the runtime: fle_realmod_table / fle_realmod_count (name, base), and when pm has rows, fle_realmod_path_table / fle_realmod_path_count
+#   (decision 0183: a plugin is opened by LoadLibraryW of its full path; fle_realmod_find_path matches the lower-case suffix). Without rows no path table is written: the weak (empty) one of fle_realmod.c stays.
